---
// The two ways into the server: the public one through Cloudflare, and the
// private one over Tailscale.
---

<figure class="diagram">
    <div class="network" role="img" aria-label="Visitors reach the server through Cloudflare. My own devices reach it over Tailscale.">
        <div class="network-row" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="node">visitors</span>
            <span class="wire">Cloudflare</span>
        </div>
        <div class="network-row" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="node">my devices</span>
            <span class="wire private">Tailscale</span>
        </div>
        <span class="node server" aria-hidden="true">the server</span>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="note">Public things come in through Cloudflare. Everything else only over Tailscale.</figcaption>
</figure>
